OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,ACalifornia sues OpenAI over Hugging
OL,4,AFace attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FOpenAI spokesperson Drew Pusateri told
OL,7,Fthe BBC in a statement that Bonta's
OL,8,Flawsuit "appears to single out OpenAI
OL,9,Fover a challenge that's been identified
OL,10,Fby every major AI lab".
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/19
